    <data name="HelpText" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Space: Play/Pause (outside text and checkbox controls)
Ctrl+O: Add files
Ctrl+Shift+O: Add folder
Ctrl+F: Search
Enter: Play selected entry
Delete: Remove selected entries (source files are preserved)
Alt+Left / Alt+Right: Previous / Next
Ctrl+Left / Ctrl+Right: Seek 5 seconds
Ctrl+Up / Ctrl+Down: Volume 5 percentage points
Esc: Clear search

Playlists, order, volume and position are saved locally. Restore never starts playback. Ctrl+Shift+Up/Down moves selected rows; clear search first. Playlist actions include a database backup and waveform refresh. Sources must be local and available offline. No internet requests are made by the application.</value>
